version 0.5.50
previous 0.5.49
- Apps that Auto, a tap or the Play Store installs get their data back in seconds again, so they no longer hang on "Getting your app" or come back signed out.
- Saves keep going while the screen is off, and signing out stops a background save and saves once instead of waiting for it to finish.
- "Backing up" and "That save captured" clear once a newer save lands, and Profile says a save is running only when one is.
- Signing in loads your storage plan and waiting messages after you land in your profile, and a store download finishes before a background save starts.
- The gate has a sun/moon for light and dark that its dialogs and Profile follow, and the sign-in fields clear when the screen turns off.
- Reset passphrase shows the new passphrase's strength, picture messages in any text encoding arrive readable, and issue reports say why the phone last restarted.
